<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BORDER 116-5 AT TEA AGAINST BOLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BORDER 116-5 AT TEA AGAINST BOLAND.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>After an early tea due to rain Border resumed the final session on 116 for five on the opening day of their Supersport series cricket match against Boland at Buffalo Park on Friday.</p>
